[
  {
    "index": 0,
    "text": "♪ Meow, meow, meow, meow, meow ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 1,
    "text": "♪ Hey, Gabby ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 2,
    "text": "♪ Take us to the Dollhouse ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 3,
    "text": "♪ Hey, Gabby ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 4,
    "text": "♪ Little by little"
  },
  {
    "index": 5,
    "text": "Let's live in the meow ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 6,
    "text": "♪ Meow, meow, meow, meow, meow, meow ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 7,
    "text": "♪ Meow, meow, meow, meow, meow, meow ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 8,
    "text": "♪ Meow, meow, meow, meow, meow ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 9,
    "text": "-♪ Hey, Gabby ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 10,
    "text": "-♪ Meow, meow, meow, meow ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 11,
    "text": "-♪ What's the big surprise? ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 12,
    "text": "-♪ Meow, meow ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 13,
    "text": "♪ Let's shrink right down and go inside ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 14,
    "text": "♪ Hey, Gabby ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 15,
    "text": "♪ Meow ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 16,
    "text": "One for you, and one for you, Floyd."
  },
  {
    "index": 17,
    "text": "Oh, hi! I'm so glad you could join us."
  },
  {
    "index": 18,
    "text": "We're having a kitty tea party."
  },
  {
    "index": 19,
    "text": "And this cup is for you."
  },
  {
    "index": 20,
    "text": "I made"
  },
  {
    "index": 21,
    "text": "some of my special pink sparkle tea."
  },
  {
    "index": 22,
    "text": "You want some, Pandy?"
  },
  {
    "index": 23,
    "text": "Whoopsie! Here you go."
  },
  {
    "index": 24,
    "text": "And some for you, Floyd."
  },
  {
    "index": 25,
    "text": "Mm! Looks tasty, huh, Floyd?"
  },
  {
    "index": 26,
    "text": "And now some for you."
  },
  {
    "index": 27,
    "text": "Tell me when to stop."
  },
  {
    "index": 28,
    "text": "Uh… Good?"
  },
  {
    "index": 29,
    "text": "Okay."
  },
  {
    "index": 30,
    "text": "And a little bit for me."
  },
  {
    "index": 31,
    "text": "All right. Let's try it."
  },
  {
    "index": 32,
    "text": "Mm!"
  },
  {
    "index": 33,
    "text": "It's kit-tea-licious!"
  },
  {
    "index": 34,
    "text": "-♪ Meow, meow, meow, meow, meow! ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 35,
    "text": "-You know what that sound means."
  },
  {
    "index": 36,
    "text": "It's time for a Dollhouse Delivery."
  },
  {
    "index": 37,
    "text": "Come on. Let's go see what it is."
  },
  {
    "index": 38,
    "text": "♪ Meow, meow, meow ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 39,
    "text": "♪ Meow ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 40,
    "text": "♪ Meow ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 41,
    "text": "♪ Meow ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 42,
    "text": "I wonder what our Meow Meow Mailbox"
  },
  {
    "index": 43,
    "text": "has for us today."
  },
  {
    "index": 44,
    "text": "Whoa!"
  },
  {
    "index": 45,
    "text": "It's a little kitty cloche."
  },
  {
    "index": 46,
    "text": "I've only seen these at fancy restaurants."
  },
  {
    "index": 47,
    "text": "I wonder"
  },
  {
    "index": 48,
    "text": "if there's a tasty surprise inside."
  },
  {
    "index": 49,
    "text": "Want to see?"
  },
  {
    "index": 50,
    "text": "Me too."
  },
  {
    "index": 51,
    "text": "It's a little Cakey bell!"
  },
  {
    "index": 52,
    "text": "Ooh!"
  },
  {
    "index": 53,
    "text": "And there's something else in here."
  },
  {
    "index": 54,
    "text": "It's the grand opening"
  },
  {
    "index": 55,
    "text": "of Cakey's new restaurant."
  },
  {
    "index": 56,
    "text": "And we're invited!"
  },
  {
    "index": 57,
    "text": "♪ Well, it's itty-bitty"
  },
  {
    "index": 58,
    "text": "With a big ole taste ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 59,
    "text": "♪ For a snack, it's the perfect place ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 60,
    "text": "♪ Come on down, the pleasure's mine ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 61,
    "text": "♪ Treat yourself to the sweet sunshine ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 62,
    "text": "♪ At Cakey's Cabinet Café ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 63,
    "text": "♪ Oh, yeah, that's Cakey's Cabinet Café ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 64,
    "text": "Mm-mm!"
  },
  {
    "index": 65,
    "text": "Wow!"
  },
  {
    "index": 66,
    "text": "Do you want to come into the Dollhouse"
  },
  {
    "index": 67,
    "text": "and see Cakey's new restaurant with us?"
  },
  {
    "index": 68,
    "text": "Cat-tastic!"
  },
  {
    "index": 69,
    "text": "Let's go."
  },
  {
    "index": 70,
    "text": "It's time to get tiny."
  },
  {
    "index": 71,
    "text": "♪ A pinch on my left"
  },
  {
    "index": 72,
    "text": "Pinch, pinch on my right ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 73,
    "text": "♪ Grab Pandy's hand and hold on tight! ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 74,
    "text": "I'm in the kitchen. Come on!"
  },
  {
    "index": 75,
    "text": "Welcome to the Dollhouse."
  },
  {
    "index": 76,
    "text": "I can't wait to try all the tasty treats"
  },
  {
    "index": 77,
    "text": "at Cakey's new restaurant."
  },
  {
    "index": 78,
    "text": "How about you, Pandy?"
  },
  {
    "index": 79,
    "text": "Pandy?"
  },
  {
    "index": 80,
    "text": "Hmm."
  },
  {
    "index": 81,
    "text": "Where is Pandy hiding this time?"
  },
  {
    "index": 82,
    "text": "Café hug attack!"
  },
  {
    "index": 83,
    "text": "Mm!"
  },
  {
    "index": 84,
    "text": "-Can Chef Cakey get in on that huggin'?"
  },
  {
    "index": 85,
    "text": "-Come on in!"
  },
  {
    "index": 86,
    "text": "Mm!"
  },
  {
    "index": 87,
    "text": "Okay. Who's ready to see…"
  },
  {
    "index": 88,
    "text": "♪ Cakey's Cabinet Café? ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 89,
    "text": "-I am!"
  },
  {
    "index": 90,
    "text": "-Me too!"
  },
  {
    "index": 91,
    "text": "Then follow me."
  },
  {
    "index": 92,
    "text": "Hey, Cakey, why do you call it…"
  },
  {
    "index": 93,
    "text": "♪ Cakey's Cabinet Café? ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 94,
    "text": "'Cause all the magic"
  },
  {
    "index": 95,
    "text": "takes place right here,"
  },
  {
    "index": 96,
    "text": "inside this cabinet."
  },
  {
    "index": 97,
    "text": "Ta-da! Cakey's Cabinet Café."
  },
  {
    "index": 98,
    "text": "It's the teeniest, tiniest,"
  },
  {
    "index": 99,
    "text": "tastiest place around."
  },
  {
    "index": 100,
    "text": "Ooh! Whoa!"
  },
  {
    "index": 101,
    "text": "I love the lights and the little plants."
  },
  {
    "index": 102,
    "text": "It's paw-esome!"
  },
  {
    "index": 103,
    "text": "But you're gonna need some"
  },
  {
    "index": 104,
    "text": "pretty tiny customers to fit in there."
  },
  {
    "index": 105,
    "text": "Oh, they're tiny, all right."
  },
  {
    "index": 106,
    "text": "And they're already lining up"
  },
  {
    "index": 107,
    "text": "to get in. Look!"
  },
  {
    "index": 108,
    "text": "Hamster Kitties! Aww!"
  },
  {
    "index": 109,
    "text": "We're not ready to open just yet, gang."
  },
  {
    "index": 110,
    "text": "But it won't be long, I promise."
  },
  {
    "index": 111,
    "text": "Those little Hamster Kitties"
  },
  {
    "index": 112,
    "text": "sure sound hungry."
  },
  {
    "index": 113,
    "text": "I need to get cooking so they'll have"
  },
  {
    "index": 114,
    "text": "something to eat at the tables."
  },
  {
    "index": 115,
    "text": "Uh, Cakey,"
  },
  {
    "index": 116,
    "text": "I don't see any tables or chairs."
  },
  {
    "index": 117,
    "text": "No tables, no chairs, and no food!"
  },
  {
    "index": 118,
    "text": "Oh, my restaurant"
  },
  {
    "index": 119,
    "text": "is never going to be ready in time!"
  },
  {
    "index": 120,
    "text": "Oh… This is terrible!"
  },
  {
    "index": 121,
    "text": "Hey, it's okay, Cakey."
  },
  {
    "index": 122,
    "text": "Your restaurant isn't ready to open yet."
  },
  {
    "index": 123,
    "text": "-But we can help you."
  },
  {
    "index": 124,
    "text": "-Really?"
  },
  {
    "index": 125,
    "text": "Of course."
  },
  {
    "index": 126,
    "text": "Asking friends to help"
  },
  {
    "index": 127,
    "text": "is like a superpower."
  },
  {
    "index": 128,
    "text": "Yeah."
  },
  {
    "index": 129,
    "text": "Why don't I go see if Baby Box can help us"
  },
  {
    "index": 130,
    "text": "craft up some tables and chairs,"
  },
  {
    "index": 131,
    "text": "while you and Pandy whip up the food?"
  },
  {
    "index": 132,
    "text": "Pandy the cook, at your service."
  },
  {
    "index": 133,
    "text": "Wow! Thanks, everybody."
  },
  {
    "index": 134,
    "text": "Okay, Chef Cakey,"
  },
  {
    "index": 135,
    "text": "what's on the menu today?"
  },
  {
    "index": 136,
    "text": "I'm glad you asked."
  },
  {
    "index": 137,
    "text": "We're making…"
  },
  {
    "index": 138,
    "text": "Mashed potatoes!"
  },
  {
    "index": 139,
    "text": "Whoa!"
  },
  {
    "index": 140,
    "text": "We've got a lot of peeling"
  },
  {
    "index": 141,
    "text": "and mashing to do."
  },
  {
    "index": 142,
    "text": "Easy-peasy, mac-and-cheesy!"
  },
  {
    "index": 143,
    "text": "I'm an expert peeler and masher."
  },
  {
    "index": 144,
    "text": "Boop."
  },
  {
    "index": 145,
    "text": "Okay, you two."
  },
  {
    "index": 146,
    "text": "I'll be back in no time"
  },
  {
    "index": 147,
    "text": "with some crafty-riffic tables and chairs."
  },
  {
    "index": 148,
    "text": "Tell Baby Box I said hi!"
  },
  {
    "index": 149,
    "text": "Phew!"
  },
  {
    "index": 150,
    "text": "Hey, Baby Box."
  },
  {
    "index": 151,
    "text": "Oh, hi! What's going on?"
  },
  {
    "index": 152,
    "text": "Well, the Hamster Kitties are all ready"
  },
  {
    "index": 153,
    "text": "for Cakey's tiny new restaurant to open."
  },
  {
    "index": 154,
    "text": "Ooh!"
  },
  {
    "index": 155,
    "text": "But Cakey doesn't have any tables"
  },
  {
    "index": 156,
    "text": "or chairs for them to sit on."
  },
  {
    "index": 157,
    "text": "Oh, that's not good."
  },
  {
    "index": 158,
    "text": "We were hoping"
  },
  {
    "index": 159,
    "text": "you could help us make some."
  },
  {
    "index": 160,
    "text": "Doodles and doodads! I'd love to help."
  },
  {
    "index": 161,
    "text": "Let's see."
  },
  {
    "index": 162,
    "text": "Ooh!"
  },
  {
    "index": 163,
    "text": "Will these work?"
  },
  {
    "index": 164,
    "text": "Those look cat-tastic, Baby Box."
  },
  {
    "index": 165,
    "text": "Then let's get crafting."
  },
  {
    "index": 166,
    "text": "We're going to start by making the chairs."
  },
  {
    "index": 167,
    "text": "These spools"
  },
  {
    "index": 168,
    "text": "will be the base of our chairs,"
  },
  {
    "index": 169,
    "text": "and these nice, soft cotton balls"
  },
  {
    "index": 170,
    "text": "can be the cushions."
  },
  {
    "index": 171,
    "text": "A little trusty glue."
  },
  {
    "index": 172,
    "text": "-Boop."
  },
  {
    "index": 173,
    "text": "-Hmm."
  },
  {
    "index": 174,
    "text": "Whoopsie!"
  },
  {
    "index": 175,
    "text": "I got a little extra glue on mine."
  },
  {
    "index": 176,
    "text": "That's okay. It'll still work."
  },
  {
    "index": 177,
    "text": "Okay."
  },
  {
    "index": 178,
    "text": "Boop."
  },
  {
    "index": 179,
    "text": "Pick a nice, colorful fabric,"
  },
  {
    "index": 180,
    "text": "place it over the cotton ball…"
  },
  {
    "index": 181,
    "text": "Then push it down,"
  },
  {
    "index": 182,
    "text": "and put a rubber band around it"
  },
  {
    "index": 183,
    "text": "to keep it in place."
  },
  {
    "index": 184,
    "text": "Like this."
  },
  {
    "index": 185,
    "text": "Ooh! Comfy!"
  },
  {
    "index": 186,
    "text": "Now we need something long and bendy"
  },
  {
    "index": 187,
    "text": "to make the back of the chair."
  },
  {
    "index": 188,
    "text": "Do you see something long and bendy?"
  },
  {
    "index": 189,
    "text": "The pipe cleaners!"
  },
  {
    "index": 190,
    "text": "These are nice and bendy."
  },
  {
    "index": 191,
    "text": "Bend it into a heart shape"
  },
  {
    "index": 192,
    "text": "with curlicues on the ends, like this."
  },
  {
    "index": 193,
    "text": "I heart your building skills, Baby Box."
  },
  {
    "index": 194,
    "text": "I heart yours too."
  },
  {
    "index": 195,
    "text": "Just tuck the ends into the rubber band."
  },
  {
    "index": 196,
    "text": "And…"
  },
  {
    "index": 197,
    "text": "Two chairs ready for Hamster tushies."
  },
  {
    "index": 198,
    "text": "And now…"
  },
  {
    "index": 199,
    "text": "For the tables."
  },
  {
    "index": 200,
    "text": "We'll start with a big spool."
  },
  {
    "index": 201,
    "text": "We need something round and flat"
  },
  {
    "index": 202,
    "text": "that we could use for the tabletop."
  },
  {
    "index": 203,
    "text": "Do you see something round and flat?"
  },
  {
    "index": 204,
    "text": "The jar lids!"
  },
  {
    "index": 205,
    "text": "We just need to glue them on."
  },
  {
    "index": 206,
    "text": "There."
  },
  {
    "index": 207,
    "text": "We can use a bigger fabric circle"
  },
  {
    "index": 208,
    "text": "for the tablecloth."
  },
  {
    "index": 209,
    "text": "Yep, looks like a table to me."
  },
  {
    "index": 210,
    "text": "And for that special café touch…"
  },
  {
    "index": 211,
    "text": "Ta-da!"
  },
  {
    "index": 212,
    "text": "A-meow-zing, Baby Box!"
  },
  {
    "index": 213,
    "text": "Let's make a couple more chairs."
  },
  {
    "index": 214,
    "text": "Then I'll take everything down to Cakey."
  },
  {
    "index": 215,
    "text": "Hmm. I wonder how he and Pandy are doing"
  },
  {
    "index": 216,
    "text": "with those mashed potatoes."
  },
  {
    "index": 217,
    "text": "Peeled and cooked potatoes,"
  },
  {
    "index": 218,
    "text": "comin' in at ya!"
  },
  {
    "index": 219,
    "text": "Phew! What's next, Cakey?"
  },
  {
    "index": 220,
    "text": "Okay, Pandy."
  },
  {
    "index": 221,
    "text": "It's mashin' time!"
  },
  {
    "index": 222,
    "text": "♪ Mush and mash ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 223,
    "text": "♪ And mix in a dash of butter"
  },
  {
    "index": 224,
    "text": "And a drop of cream ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 225,
    "text": "♪ Butter and a drop of cream ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 226,
    "text": "♪ Mush and mash ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 227,
    "text": "♪ A mush and mash ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 228,
    "text": "♪ Makin' our mashed potatoes ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 229,
    "text": "♪ Makin' our mashed potatoes ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 230,
    "text": "Whoo!"
  },
  {
    "index": 231,
    "text": "Mm! Oh!"
  },
  {
    "index": 232,
    "text": "Did somebody order some tables and chairs?"
  },
  {
    "index": 233,
    "text": "Wow!"
  },
  {
    "index": 234,
    "text": "Those tables and chairs are the sweetest!"
  },
  {
    "index": 235,
    "text": "-They're Baby Box specials."
  },
  {
    "index": 236,
    "text": "-Let's see how they look in the café."
  },
  {
    "index": 237,
    "text": "A perfect fit! The Hamster Kitties"
  },
  {
    "index": 238,
    "text": "are going to love them."
  },
  {
    "index": 239,
    "text": "We have tables and chairs,"
  },
  {
    "index": 240,
    "text": "and a fresh batch"
  },
  {
    "index": 241,
    "text": "of tasty mashed potatoes."
  },
  {
    "index": 242,
    "text": "I think this teeny restaurant"
  },
  {
    "index": 243,
    "text": "is ready for business."
  },
  {
    "index": 244,
    "text": "Hamster Kitties,"
  },
  {
    "index": 245,
    "text": "welcome to Cakey's Cabinet Café."
  },
  {
    "index": 246,
    "text": "Sit wherever you'd like."
  },
  {
    "index": 247,
    "text": "Someone will be right in"
  },
  {
    "index": 248,
    "text": "to take your orders."
  },
  {
    "index": 249,
    "text": "Uh-oh!"
  },
  {
    "index": 250,
    "text": "What's wrong, Cakey?"
  },
  {
    "index": 251,
    "text": "I need a teeny-tiny server"
  },
  {
    "index": 252,
    "text": "to take the Hamster Kitties' orders."
  },
  {
    "index": 253,
    "text": "Who are we going to get to do that?"
  },
  {
    "index": 254,
    "text": "Mm!"
  },
  {
    "index": 255,
    "text": "Something smells tasty."
  },
  {
    "index": 256,
    "text": "CatRat!"
  },
  {
    "index": 257,
    "text": "-Yes?"
  },
  {
    "index": 258,
    "text": "-Ooh! My new restaurant just opened."
  },
  {
    "index": 259,
    "text": "We need a shrunken waiter"
  },
  {
    "index": 260,
    "text": "to take Hamster Kitties' orders."
  },
  {
    "index": 261,
    "text": "Could you do it, CatRat? Pretty please?"
  },
  {
    "index": 262,
    "text": "Wait, wait, wait, wait!"
  },
  {
    "index": 263,
    "text": "Restaurant? Shrinking Hamster Kitties?"
  },
  {
    "index": 264,
    "text": "What's happening?"
  },
  {
    "index": 265,
    "text": "A teeny-tiny"
  },
  {
    "index": 266,
    "text": "Hamster Kitty restaurant?"
  },
  {
    "index": 267,
    "text": "Aww!"
  },
  {
    "index": 268,
    "text": "Well, that's pretty much"
  },
  {
    "index": 269,
    "text": "the cutest thing I've ever seen."
  },
  {
    "index": 270,
    "text": "Well, what do you say, CatRat?"
  },
  {
    "index": 271,
    "text": "Do you think"
  },
  {
    "index": 272,
    "text": "you could handle the waiter job?"
  },
  {
    "index": 273,
    "text": "Pah! Are you kitten me?"
  },
  {
    "index": 274,
    "text": "The CatRat has worked"
  },
  {
    "index": 275,
    "text": "in many of the finest establishments."
  },
  {
    "index": 276,
    "text": "I can host. \"Right this way, madam.\""
  },
  {
    "index": 277,
    "text": "I can serve."
  },
  {
    "index": 278,
    "text": "\"And what can I get for you this evening?\""
  },
  {
    "index": 279,
    "text": "I can put on a show."
  },
  {
    "index": 280,
    "text": "Ha-cha! I'm here all week, folks."
  },
  {
    "index": 281,
    "text": "You name it, the CatRat can do it."
  },
  {
    "index": 282,
    "text": "Thanks, CatRat."
  },
  {
    "index": 283,
    "text": "Are you ready to get tiny?"
  },
  {
    "index": 284,
    "text": "I'm always ready."
  },
  {
    "index": 285,
    "text": "Wahoo!"
  },
  {
    "index": 286,
    "text": "Tiny CatRat, ready to go!"
  },
  {
    "index": 287,
    "text": "-Hop in, tiny CatRat."
  },
  {
    "index": 288,
    "text": "-Thanks!"
  },
  {
    "index": 289,
    "text": "Oh!"
  },
  {
    "index": 290,
    "text": "Ring this bell"
  },
  {
    "index": 291,
    "text": "when you're ready to come up."
  },
  {
    "index": 292,
    "text": "You betcha!"
  },
  {
    "index": 293,
    "text": "Going down."
  },
  {
    "index": 294,
    "text": "All right, Hamster Kitties,"
  },
  {
    "index": 295,
    "text": "CatRat, your server, has arrived."
  },
  {
    "index": 296,
    "text": "Good evening."
  },
  {
    "index": 297,
    "text": "Might I recommend the special?"
  },
  {
    "index": 298,
    "text": "Très bien."
  },
  {
    "index": 299,
    "text": "And what can I get for you?"
  },
  {
    "index": 300,
    "text": "Ah, yes. Excellent choice."
  },
  {
    "index": 301,
    "text": "I'll be back in a jiffy."
  },
  {
    "index": 302,
    "text": "I've got you, CatRat."
  },
  {
    "index": 303,
    "text": "Phew! Don't let their small size fool ya."
  },
  {
    "index": 304,
    "text": "They ordered a lot of food."
  },
  {
    "index": 305,
    "text": "And they're super excited"
  },
  {
    "index": 306,
    "text": "about the big dinner show."
  },
  {
    "index": 307,
    "text": "Show? What show? I didn't plan a show."
  },
  {
    "index": 308,
    "text": "Not to worry, Cakey."
  },
  {
    "index": 309,
    "text": "The CatRat's got it covered."
  },
  {
    "index": 310,
    "text": "I should probably sneak in"
  },
  {
    "index": 311,
    "text": "a quick rehearsal with the band, though."
  },
  {
    "index": 312,
    "text": "What band? We don't have a band."
