  {
    "index": 313,
    "text": "Hmm."
  },
  {
    "index": 314,
    "text": "Oh! Hey, Pandy."
  },
  {
    "index": 315,
    "text": "Got any googly eyes in that pack of yours?"
  },
  {
    "index": 316,
    "text": "Always."
  },
  {
    "index": 317,
    "text": "Here you go."
  },
  {
    "index": 318,
    "text": "Thanks."
  },
  {
    "index": 319,
    "text": "Okay, I got everything I need."
  },
  {
    "index": 320,
    "text": "I'll see you at the show."
  },
  {
    "index": 321,
    "text": "Toodley-doo!"
  },
  {
    "index": 322,
    "text": "Oh, sprinkles!"
  },
  {
    "index": 323,
    "text": "I'm sure it'll all be fine, Cakey."
  },
  {
    "index": 324,
    "text": "Why don't we take a look at that order?"
  },
  {
    "index": 325,
    "text": "I've got it right here. Let's see."
  },
  {
    "index": 326,
    "text": "Three orders of mashed potatoes,"
  },
  {
    "index": 327,
    "text": "and four orders of mac and cheese."
  },
  {
    "index": 328,
    "text": "Wait! We didn't make any mac and cheese!"
  },
  {
    "index": 329,
    "text": "CatRat!"
  },
  {
    "index": 330,
    "text": "Okay, Pandy, we've got this."
  },
  {
    "index": 331,
    "text": "We just need to whip up"
  },
  {
    "index": 332,
    "text": "some mac and cheese super quick."
  },
  {
    "index": 333,
    "text": "Let me grab some macaroni and…"
  },
  {
    "index": 334,
    "text": "Huh? Uh-oh."
  },
  {
    "index": 335,
    "text": "I'm all out of pasta!"
  },
  {
    "index": 336,
    "text": "But I know where we can get some."
  },
  {
    "index": 337,
    "text": "This way to Pasta Paradise."
  },
  {
    "index": 338,
    "text": "Follow me!"
  },
  {
    "index": 339,
    "text": "Follow him."
  },
  {
    "index": 340,
    "text": "Whoa! Check it out!"
  },
  {
    "index": 341,
    "text": "Pasta trees."
  },
  {
    "index": 342,
    "text": "Pasta flowers."
  },
  {
    "index": 343,
    "text": "Even the birds are made of pasta!"
  },
  {
    "index": 344,
    "text": "Yep. This is Pasta Paradise."
  },
  {
    "index": 345,
    "text": "All the macaroni you can eat."
  },
  {
    "index": 346,
    "text": "We just have to collect it."
  },
  {
    "index": 347,
    "text": "Ready for a tour?"
  },
  {
    "index": 348,
    "text": "Whee!"
  },
  {
    "index": 349,
    "text": "Let's do it!"
  },
  {
    "index": 350,
    "text": "Whee!"
  },
  {
    "index": 351,
    "text": "♪ Linguini ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 352,
    "text": "♪ Fettuccine ♪"
