  {
    "index": 366,
    "text": "♪ Those and so many more ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 367,
    "text": "♪ Welcome to Pasta Paradise ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 368,
    "text": "♪ Just look at all the different types ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 369,
    "text": "♪ Yes, pasta shapes our world ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 370,
    "text": "♪ Anything is pasta-ble ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 371,
    "text": "♪ A ravioli rabbit ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 372,
    "text": "♪ A Linguini lion ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 373,
    "text": "♪ A bow-tied bow tie ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 374,
    "text": "♪ Farfalle! ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 375,
    "text": "-♪ How about gnocchi? ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 376,
    "text": "-♪ Gnocchi-dokey! ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 377,
    "text": "♪ Toss the macaroni, Macaroni Guy! ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 378,
    "text": "♪ Welcome to Pasta Paradise ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 379,
    "text": "Whoo!"
  },
  {
    "index": 380,
    "text": "Check out all the macaroni we caught."
  },
  {
    "index": 381,
    "text": "Now we just need to cook it."
  },
  {
    "index": 382,
    "text": "Oh, Pasta Dragon?"
  },
  {
    "index": 383,
    "text": "-Whoa!"
  },
  {
    "index": 384,
    "text": "-Hello, Pasta Dragon."
  },
  {
    "index": 385,
    "text": "Would you mind"
  },
  {
    "index": 386,
    "text": "cooking up this pasta for us?"
  },
  {
    "index": 387,
    "text": "Thanks, Pasta Dragon."
  },
  {
    "index": 388,
    "text": "Bye, Pasta Dragon!"
  },
  {
    "index": 389,
    "text": "Let's get back to the kitchen."
  },
  {
    "index": 390,
    "text": "We've got hungry Hamster Kitties to feed."
  },
  {
    "index": 391,
    "text": "Let's go!"
  },
  {
    "index": 392,
    "text": "Now we just need some cheese sauce."
  },
  {
    "index": 393,
    "text": "Give it a stir, Pandy."
  },
  {
    "index": 394,
    "text": "Mm!"
  },
  {
    "index": 395,
    "text": "Cheesy."
  },
  {
    "index": 396,
    "text": "Mac and cheese is ready."
  },
  {
    "index": 397,
    "text": "I've got the tiny bowls."
  },
  {
    "index": 398,
    "text": "Pandy, how many bowls do we need?"
  },
  {
    "index": 399,
    "text": "Let's see."
  },
  {
    "index": 400,
    "text": "How many bowls of mac and cheese"
  },
  {
    "index": 401,
    "text": "are on CatRat's list?"
  },
  {
    "index": 402,
    "text": "Four!"
  },
  {
    "index": 403,
    "text": "I'm on it."
  },
  {
    "index": 404,
    "text": "Uh…"
  },
  {
    "index": 405,
    "text": "Hang on."
  },
  {
    "index": 406,
    "text": "I think I need a different serving tool."
  },
  {
    "index": 407,
    "text": "Okay. We need four bowls"
  },
  {
    "index": 408,
    "text": "of macaroni and cheese."
  },
  {
    "index": 409,
    "text": "Count with me."
  },
  {
    "index": 410,
    "text": "One."
  },
  {
    "index": 411,
    "text": "Two."
  },
  {
    "index": 412,
    "text": "Three."
  },
  {
    "index": 413,
    "text": "Four."
  },
  {
    "index": 414,
    "text": "Nice."
  },
  {
    "index": 415,
    "text": "And how many mashed potatoes?"
  },
  {
    "index": 416,
    "text": "How many bowls of mash?"
  },
  {
    "index": 417,
    "text": "Three!"
  },
  {
    "index": 418,
    "text": "One."
  },
  {
    "index": 419,
    "text": "Two."
  },
  {
    "index": 420,
    "text": "Three. All right. Order up."
  },
  {
    "index": 421,
    "text": "And dinner is served."
  },
  {
    "index": 422,
    "text": "Who's hungry?"
  },
  {
    "index": 423,
    "text": "How's everything tasting in there?"
  },
  {
    "index": 424,
    "text": "I think that's Hamster Kitty"
  },
  {
    "index": 425,
    "text": "for \"delicious!\""
  },
  {
    "index": 426,
    "text": "Ladies and gentlemen,"
  },
  {
    "index": 427,
    "text": "please put your paws together for…"
  },
