    "index": 428,
    "text": "CatRat and The Spoons!"
  },
  {
    "index": 429,
    "text": "♪ If you want entertainment ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 430,
    "text": "♪ Get a load of me!"
  },
  {
    "index": 431,
    "text": "Pull up a chair, you're in good company ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 432,
    "text": "♪ Doing quirky-cat bop"
  },
  {
    "index": 433,
    "text": "With a spoonful of jazz ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 434,
    "text": "♪ Speaking of spoons"
  },
  {
    "index": 435,
    "text": "Give it up for the band ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 436,
    "text": "♪ At Cakey's Cabinet Café ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 437,
    "text": "♪ You know the one ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 438,
    "text": "♪ It's Cakey's Cabinet Café ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 439,
    "text": "Let me get to know ya."
  },
  {
    "index": 440,
    "text": "Hey, there. Where ya from?"
  },
  {
    "index": 441,
    "text": "The craft room? Say hello"
  },
  {
    "index": 442,
    "text": "to the Box Family for me, will ya?"
  },
  {
    "index": 443,
    "text": "What brings you lovely folks here tonight?"
  },
  {
    "index": 444,
    "text": "Ooh! That's my favorite too."
  },
  {
    "index": 445,
    "text": "Can I tell ya something?"
  },
  {
    "index": 446,
    "text": "♪ Well, it's itty-bitty"
  },
  {
    "index": 447,
    "text": "With a big ole taste ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 448,
    "text": "♪ For a snack, it's the perfect place ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 449,
    "text": "♪ So, come on down ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 450,
    "text": "♪ The pleasure's mine ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 451,
    "text": "♪ Treat yourself to the sweet sunshine ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 452,
    "text": "♪ At Cakey's Cabinet Café ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 453,
    "text": "Mm-mm!"
  },
  {
    "index": 454,
    "text": "Yay, CatRat!"
  },
  {
    "index": 455,
    "text": "That was a-meow-zing!"
  },
  {
    "index": 456,
    "text": "Thank you!"
  },
  {
    "index": 457,
    "text": "Thank you so much! Oh, thank you!"
  },
  {
    "index": 458,
    "text": "Oh! And let's hear it for The Spoons!"
  },
  {
    "index": 459,
    "text": "And now, as a surprise treat,"
  },
  {
    "index": 460,
    "text": "I'd like to announce"
  },
  {
    "index": 461,
    "text": "our special Cakey's Cabinet Café dessert."
  },
  {
    "index": 462,
    "text": "Dessert?"
  },
  {
    "index": 463,
    "text": "Ice cream for everyone!"
  },
  {
    "index": 464,
    "text": "Cakey?"
  },
  {
    "index": 465,
    "text": "CatRat, we didn't make any dessert!"
  },
  {
    "index": 466,
    "text": "Oh, I gotcha, buddy."
  },
  {
    "index": 467,
    "text": "Beep, beep!"
  },
  {
    "index": 468,
    "text": "Ooh! Hi, Carlita."
  },
  {
    "index": 469,
    "text": "Did someone say ice cream?"
  },
  {
    "index": 470,
    "text": "Wahoo! Carlita the Ice Cream Truck!"
  },
  {
    "index": 471,
    "text": "That was almost a dessert disaster."
  },
  {
    "index": 472,
    "text": "Dessert is served."
  },
  {
    "index": 473,
    "text": "Who wants some sprinkles?"
  },
  {
    "index": 474,
    "text": "Whee!"
  },
  {
    "index": 475,
    "text": "You can't have ice cream"
  },
  {
    "index": 476,
    "text": "without sprinkles."
  },
  {
    "index": 477,
    "text": "Mwah!"
  },
  {
    "index": 478,
    "text": "Well, it's official."
  },
  {
    "index": 479,
    "text": "Cakey's Cabinet Café is a huge success."
  },
  {
    "index": 480,
    "text": "Wow! It really is."
  },
  {
    "index": 481,
    "text": "And I couldn't have done it"
  },
  {
    "index": 482,
    "text": "without all of you."
  },
  {
    "index": 483,
    "text": "Asking friends to help"
  },
  {
    "index": 484,
    "text": "really is a superpower."
  },
  {
    "index": 485,
    "text": "Thanks, everybody."
  },
  {
    "index": 486,
    "text": "Aww!"
  },
  {
    "index": 487,
    "text": "We're always here when you need us, Cakey."
  },
  {
    "index": 488,
    "text": "Definitely."
  },
  {
    "index": 489,
    "text": "Beep-beep to that!"
  },
  {
    "index": 490,
    "text": "It's true!"
  },
  {
    "index": 491,
    "text": "Thanks for all your help today."
  },
  {
    "index": 492,
    "text": "Are you ready for one more surprise?"
  },
  {
    "index": 493,
    "text": "♪ Gabby Cat, Gabby Cat ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 494,
    "text": "♪ Gabby Cat, Gabby Cat ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 495,
    "text": "♪ Gabby Cat, Gabby Cat ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 496,
    "text": "♪ Gabby Cat, Gabby Cat ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 497,
    "text": "♪ Gabby Cat, Gabby Cat"
  },
  {
    "index": 498,
    "text": "Gabby Cat, Gabby Cat ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 499,
    "text": "♪ Gabby Cat of the Day! ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 500,
    "text": "It's me, Cakey!"
  },
  {
    "index": 501,
    "text": "Oh, sprinkles!"
  },
  {
    "index": 502,
    "text": "I'm so glad you're here."
  },
  {
    "index": 503,
    "text": "You want to see"
  },
  {
    "index": 504,
    "text": "something super-duper sweet?"
  },
  {
    "index": 505,
    "text": "Ta-da! It's a donut kitty."
  },
  {
    "index": 506,
    "text": "Want me to show you how to make one?"
  },
  {
    "index": 507,
    "text": "Yay!"
  },
  {
    "index": 508,
    "text": "Okay."
  },
  {
    "index": 509,
    "text": "To make a donut kitty,"
  },
  {
    "index": 510,
    "text": "you need a plain donut,"
  },
  {
    "index": 511,
    "text": "some pink frosting,"
  },
  {
    "index": 512,
    "text": "strawberries,"
  },
  {
    "index": 513,
    "text": "some chocolate chips,"
  },
  {
    "index": 514,
    "text": "chocolate frosting,"
  },
  {
    "index": 515,
    "text": "and of course,"
  },
  {
    "index": 516,
    "text": "sprinkles!"
  },
  {
    "index": 517,
    "text": "♪ It's time to frost the donut ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 518,
    "text": "♪ Frost the donut ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 519,
    "text": "Whoo! And now for my favorite part."
  },
  {
    "index": 520,
    "text": "Sprinkles!"
  },
  {
    "index": 521,
    "text": "Let's shakey with Cakey."
  },
  {
    "index": 522,
    "text": "♪ A shake, shake, shake"
  },
  {
    "index": 523,
    "text": "And a shake, shake, shake ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 524,
    "text": "Sprinkles"
  },
  {
    "index": 525,
    "text": "just make everything better,"
  },
  {
    "index": 526,
    "text": "don't you think?"
  },
  {
    "index": 527,
    "text": "Let's keep going."
  },
  {
    "index": 528,
    "text": "Now let's add some little strawberry ears."
  },
  {
    "index": 529,
    "text": "Boop! Boop!"
  },
  {
    "index": 530,
    "text": "Two chocolate-chip eyes."
  },
  {
    "index": 531,
    "text": "Smush! Smush!"
  },
  {
    "index": 532,
    "text": "And for the finishing touch,"
  },
  {
    "index": 533,
    "text": "a chocolate-frosting kitty nose,"
  },
  {
    "index": 534,
    "text": "a sweet smile,"
  },
  {
    "index": 535,
    "text": "and four sprinkle whiskers."
  },
  {
    "index": 536,
    "text": "Kitty-licious!"
  },
  {
    "index": 537,
    "text": "Aww! This donut kitty"
  },
  {
    "index": 538,
    "text": "might just be too cute to eat."
  },
  {
    "index": 539,
    "text": "Nah! I'm definitely gonna eat it."
  },
  {
    "index": 540,
    "text": "Come back soon and bakey with Cakey! Bye!"
  },
  {
    "index": 541,
    "text": "I think Cakey's Cabinet Café"
  },
  {
    "index": 542,
    "text": "was a big success, don't you?"
  },
  {
    "index": 543,
    "text": "Thanks for all your help"
  },
  {
    "index": 544,
    "text": "in getting everything ready."
  },
  {
    "index": 545,
    "text": "Oh!"
  },
  {
    "index": 546,
    "text": "And I made us some kitty donuts"
  },
  {
    "index": 547,
    "text": "to go with our tea,"
  },
  {
    "index": 548,
    "text": "with strawberry ears,"
  },
